# Phase 6: Admin Panel AI Knowledge Base + Ready Reckoner — Full Upgrade

## Overview
A comprehensive overhaul of the Admin Panel's AI Knowledge Base module and the Student Dashboard's Summary tool (renamed **Ready Reckoner**). Fixes the critical archive bug, delivers 10+ UX/functionality improvements across all 4 admin tabs, and completely redesigns the Summary AI tool to be a structured, formula-aware chapter revision tool.

---

## 🐛 Critical Bug Fix (Priority #1)

### Archive Constraint Violation
**Error:** `org.hibernate.exception.ConstraintViolationException` — `chapters_processing_status_check` violated when setting status to `ARCHIVED`.

**Root Cause:** The live PostgreSQL DB has a `CHECK` constraint on `processing_status` created with only 5 allowed values (`PENDING, PROCESSING, PROCESSED, FAILED, PUBLISHED`). The Java enum `ProcessingStatus` has 6 values — `ARCHIVED` was added later but the DB constraint was never updated.

> [!CAUTION]
> This requires a one-time SQL migration on the live DB. Must be run **before** any archive actions are attempted.

**Fix SQL:**
```sql
-- Step 1: Drop the stale constraint
ALTER TABLE chapters DROP CONSTRAINT IF EXISTS chapters_processing_status_check;

-- Step 2: Recreate with all 6 valid enum values
ALTER TABLE chapters ADD CONSTRAINT chapters_processing_status_check
  CHECK (processing_status IN ('PENDING','PROCESSING','PROCESSED','FAILED','PUBLISHED','ARCHIVED'));

-- Step 3: Add missing columns (if not already present)
ALTER TABLE chapters ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS chapter_number INTEGER;
ALTER TABLE chapters ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS archived_by VARCHAR(100);
ALTER TABLE chapters ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS archived_at TIMESTAMP;
```

